  "title": "SafeCoEvo: Co-Evolving Safety Harnesses and Guards for LLM Agents at Test-Time",
  "summary": "SafeCoEvo is a test-time Harness-Guard co-evolution framework for LLM agents, enabling external safety systems to adapt from past runtime experience. It combines short-term rapid adaptation with long-term capability consolidation to improve safety and task utility.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "SafeCoEvo addresses the limitation of real-world deployment by enabling test-time adaptation through harness evolution.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "SafeCoEvo jointly improves S-Harness and GuardVPO capabilities at different timescales, reducing unsafe outcomes by 10.05% and improving task success rates by 12.15%.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Compositional safety failures in harness evolution are identified and addressed through a hypergraph-guided runtime monitoring mechanism.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
